{
  "$comment": [
    "The reviewed security posture of every application function, shared by two checks that",
    "see different databases: tests/rls/baseline.test.ts (a fresh local stack, in the required",
    "RLS job) and scripts/verify-function-grants.mjs (production, after Deploy Migrations).",
    "Neither can see the other's database, and #384 was exactly the drift that gap allowed.",
    "Read baseline.test.ts's docstring before changing an entry: it holds the reasoning for",
    "each one, and for the rule that a new function migration must revoke from anon and",
    "service_role explicitly, not just from public."
  ],
